bash
git add .
. ka matlab hai — saari files aur folders add karo.

Verify ki kya add hua:

bash
git status
Sab files green me dikhni chahiye (staged files).

📌 STEP 5: Commit Karo
bash
git commit -m "Initial commit: Enterprise Simulation Engine setup"
Agar ye error aaya — Please tell me who you are → Step 3 dobara kar.

📌 STEP 6: Branch Name Set Karo
bash
git branch -M main
