🚀 Git Commands — Complete Step-by-Step Guide
Bhai, ab main tujhe har command step-by-step batata hoon jo tu CMD / PowerShell / Git Bash me chalayega. Ye commands tere current repo (vishakha2121/enterprise-simulation-engine) ke liye ready hain.

📌 STEP 0: Pehle Ye Check Kar
CMD khol aur ye chala:

bash
git --version
Agar version dikha (jaise git version 2.42.0) → ✅ aage badh

Agar not recognized aaya → Git install kar: https://git-scm.com/download/win

