⚠️ COMMON ERRORS & FIXES
🔴 Error 1: failed to push some refs / rejected
Matlab GitHub pe pehle se README ya file hai. Pehle pull kar:

bash
git pull origin main --allow-unrelated-histories
Agar conflict aaye toh manually resolve kar, phir:

bash
git add .
git commit -m "Merge remote changes"
git push -u origin main
🔴 Error 2: fatal: not a git repository
Galat folder me hai. Check kar:

bash
cd C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\enterprise-simulation-engine
git init
🔴 Error 3: src refspec main does not match any
Commit nahi hua. Pehle:

bash
git add .
git commit -m "first commit"
git push -u origin main
🔴 Error 4: Authentication failed
PAT galat ya expire ho gaya. Naya PAT bana (upar wala process) aur dobara push kar.

🔴 Error 5: .env file push ho gayi (secret leak)
Turant delete kar:

bash
git rm --cached .env
git commit -m "Remove .env from tracking"
git push
Phir .env ko .gitignore me add kar (agar nahi kiya).

