🚀 Git Commands — Complete Step-by-Step Guide
Bhai, ab main tujhe har command step-by-step batata hoon jo tu CMD / PowerShell / Git Bash me chalayega. Ye commands tere current repo (vishakha2121/enterprise-simulation-engine) ke liye ready hain.

📌 STEP 0: Pehle Ye Check Kar
CMD khol aur ye chala:

bash
git --version
Agar version dikha (jaise git version 2.42.0) → ✅ aage badh

Agar not recognized aaya → Git install kar: https://git-scm.com/download/win

📌 STEP 1: Apne Project Folder Me Jao
CMD me apne project folder tak navigate kar. Example:

bash
cd C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\enterprise-simulation-engine
Verify kar ki sahi folder me hai:

bash
dir
Ye teri files dikhayega (README.md, backend, frontend, etc.)

📌 STEP 2: Git Initialize Karo (Sirf Pehli Baar)
Agar folder me .git folder nahi hai toh ye chala:

bash
git init
Check kar ki Git initialized hai:

bash
git status
Output me On branch main ya On branch master dikhega.

📌 STEP 3: Git Config Setup (Sirf Pehli Baar)
Apna naam aur email set kar (jo GitHub pe hai):

bash
git config --global user.name "Vishakha"
git config --global user.email "your-email@gmail.com"
⚠️ your-email@gmail.com apne actual GitHub email se replace kar dena.

Verify:

bash
git config --global --list
📌 STEP 4: Files Add Karo (Staging)
bash
git add .
. ka matlab hai — saari files aur folders add karo.

Verify ki kya add hua:

bash
git status
Sab files green me dikhni chahiye (staged files).

📌 STEP 5: Commit Karo
bash
git commit -m "Initial commit: Enterprise Simulation Engine setup"
Agar ye error aaya — Please tell me who you are → Step 3 dobara kar.

📌 STEP 6: Branch Name Set Karo
bash
git branch -M main
📌 STEP 7: Remote Add Karo (Sirf Pehli Baar)
bash
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-simulation-engine.git
Agar remote origin already exists error aaya toh pehle remove kar:

bash
git remote remove origin
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-simulation-engine.git
Verify:

bash
git remote -v
Output me GitHub URL dikhna chahiye.

📌 STEP 8: Push Karo 🚀
bash
git push -u origin main
🔐 Agar Username/Password Puche:
Username: vishakha2121

Password: ❌ Apna GitHub password mat daal — wo kaam nahi karega. GitHub ne password auth band kar diya hai.

✅ Solution — Personal Access Token (PAT) use kar:

PAT Banane Ka Tarika:
Browser me khol: https://github.com/settings/tokens

"Generate new token" → "Generate new token (classic)" click kar

Note: enterprise-simulation-engine

Expiration: 90 days (ya No expiration)

Scopes me tick kar:

✅ repo (full control)

✅ workflow (agar GitHub Actions use karega)

Generate token click kar

Token copy kar (ek baar hi dikhega — safe rakh!)

Ab Push Karte Waqt:
bash
git push -u origin main
Username: vishakha2121

Password: PAT paste kar (Ctrl+V — kuch nahi dikhega screen pe, normal hai)

⚠️ COMMON ERRORS & FIXES
🔴 Error 1: failed to push some refs / rejected
Matlab GitHub pe pehle se README ya file hai. Pehle pull kar:

bash
git pull origin main --allow-unrelated-histories
Agar conflict aaye toh manually resolve kar, phir:

bash
git add .
git commit -m "Merge remote changes"
git push -u origin main
🔴 Error 2: fatal: not a git repository
Galat folder me hai. Check kar:

bash
cd C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\enterprise-simulation-engine
git init
🔴 Error 3: src refspec main does not match any
Commit nahi hua. Pehle:

bash
git add .
git commit -m "first commit"
git push -u origin main
🔴 Error 4: Authentication failed
PAT galat ya expire ho gaya. Naya PAT bana (upar wala process) aur dobara push kar.

🔴 Error 5: .env file push ho gayi (secret leak)
Turant delete kar:

bash
git rm --cached .env
git commit -m "Remove .env from tracking"
git push
Phir .env ko .gitignore me add kar (agar nahi kiya).

🎬 COMPLETE ONE-SHOT SCRIPT (Copy-Paste)
Agar tu fresh start kar raha hai aur sab ek saath chahiye — ye paste kar de:

bash
cd path\to\enterprise-simulation-engine
git init
git config --global user.name "Vishakha"
git config --global user.email "your-email@gmail.com"
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit: Enterprise Simulation Engine setup"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-simulation-engine.git
git push -u origin main
Bas your-email@gmail.com aur folder path apne hisaab se replace kar dena.

