📋 QUICK REFERENCE CHEAT SHEET
Command	Kaam
git init	Naya repo initialize
git status	Current state dekho
git add .	Saari files stage karo
git add file.txt	Specific file stage karo
git commit -m "msg"	Commit banao
git push	GitHub pe bhejo
git pull	GitHub se latest lao
git log --oneline	Commit history dekho
git remote -v	Remote URL dekho
git branch -M main	Branch rename
git rm --cached file	File untrack karo (delete nahi)
